<title>UK: Carlton '96 pre-tax profit rises 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Carlton '96 pre-tax profit rises 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence, basic)    31.6		    vs 26.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.72		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 11.09		  up 9.44</p>
<p> Pretax		    295.1		   vs 246.7</p>
<p> Turnover		 1,677.5		  vs 1,579.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 290 and 296.9 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Carlton Communications Plc.</p>
</text>
